# ekat testit

### Palvelimen juuri
GET http://localhost:3000

### morotesti
GET http://localhost:3000/moro

### morotesti POST
POST http://localhost:3000/api/moro
content-type: application/json

{
  "sender": "kalle",
  "message": "testitervehdys"
}

## items

### get all items
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items

### get item by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items/3

### post new item
POST http://localhost:3000/api/items
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sitruuna"
}

### update item by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/items/3
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Uusi Porkkana"
}

### delete item by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/items/3

## users

### get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/1

### post a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "newpassword",
  "email": "newuser@example.com"
}

### update user by ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/2
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "janedoe_updated",
  "password": "newpassword2",
  "email": "janedoe_updated@example.com"
}

### dummy login (valid credentials)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "password": "password1"
}

### dummy login (invalid credentials)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "invaliduser",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}